From 1103fc88efbab01427295e896798cff758182733 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 07:03:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: score phishing pages after DOMContentLoaded

Collect password fields and page copy from the renderer, blend them
with the URL heuristic, and reload into the interstitial when the
combined score crosses the block threshold.
